    "stagger": "Reveal, one-for-one with the original's ScrollAnimate output (develop, cobalt, data-modernization): grid 0 > left col 0 > <span> per item stepping 100ms from 0 (eyebrow?, h2, p), then the button row at the next step with each button in its own <span> (row + 0 / +100); aside col 100 > space-y-6 100 > <span> h 100, <span> p 200, <span> link 300. develop: 12 targets 0-300 | data-modernization (eyebrow, no aside): 8 targets 0-400. The wrappers are inline <span>s like the original's, so those items fade without translating. The aside heading is an <h4> on the original (heading-4 styling). T12-T13 additions (specs/T12-T13.md B \"H-cta short additions\"): `checklist` aside: space-y-6 list (100) of rows of a 24x25 white check + 24/32 text; row k and its check at 100+100k, its text +200 (as on lattice-learn; the original's extra zero-size spans inside and after each check are not reproduced) `stats` aside: 1px #e5e7eb divider (top below 768, left at >=768), md:pl-15, two stats (32/38.4 400 value + 18/28 label) `wide`: the left column spans all 12 columns (no aside); no buttons -> no button row"
